	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Wurth Elektronik 750313734 WE-PPTI push-pull transformer, SMD, size/type 1209. 1:1.1 (N1+N2 : N3+N4), centre-tapped on BOTH sides. REINFORCED insulation 800 Vrms / 1400 Vpk per IEC62368-1 (OVC II to 4 km, or OVC III to 3 km); 5000 Vrms hipot N1,2 => N3,4; 9.2 mm min creepage and 8.0 mm min clearance PRI-SEC per IEC61800-5-1. Manufacturer recommended land pattern: 6 pads 1.9 x 1.14 mm, rows 11.31 mm apart centre-to-centre, 3.05 mm pitch within each row; left column pins 1,2,3 and right column pins 6,5,4 - matches the mcuc:WE_750313734 schematic symbol (1 = PRI start, 2 = PRI centre tap, 3 = PRI end, 6 = SEC start, 5 = SEC centre tap, 4 = SEC end). Body 12.7 x 9.14 mm max, 7.62 mm max seated height; pin cross-section 0.71 x 0.41 mm. Pad centres and body envelope taken from the rendered Wurth mechanical drawing / recommended land pattern on datasheet 750313734 rev 008.002 (2024-01-11).")
	(tags "Wurth WE-PPTI push-pull transformer SMD reinforced isolated 5kV")
